147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It is with great honor that I welcome you to the first edition of our Model United Nations. This conference is not just a simulation, it is a platform where young leaders come together to question, deliberate and reimagine solutions for the challenges of our time.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our world today faces pressing issues: climate change, pandemics, conflicts, economic divides and humanitarian crises that test the strength of global cooperation. In such times, the value of dialogue, diplomacy and collective action cannot be overstated. This MUN seeks to ignite those very qualities in every delegate.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Here, you are not just participants, you are diplomats, innovators and changemakers. The debates you engage in, the resolutions you draft and the collaborations you build will go far beyond the committee rooms; they will shape how you view leadership, responsibility and the global community.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I urge you to approach this conference with courage, empathy and curiosity. Listen as much as you speak, challenge ideas but respect perspectives and above all, remember that every word has the power to inspire change.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
