164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (MUNERA is more than a conference, it is a dynamic arena where young leaders step into the shoes of diplomats, policymakers and change-makers. Over the course of the event, delegates confront pressing global and national challenges ranging from gender equality and sustainable development to climate action, financial accountability  and human rights. Each committee is designed to test intellect, sharpen negotiation and encourage bold, solution-driven dialogue.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Whether navigating the complexities of international power politics, debating in the high energy chambers of the Lok Sabha, or capturing history in the international press, every delegate at MUNERA contributes to conversations that matter.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (What sets MUNERA apart is its balance of rigorous debate and meaningful connections. Backed by a passionate secretariat and experienced faculty, the conference ensures smooth organization, structured deliberation and an academic experience that challenges and inspires. Beyond the sessions, MUNERA is a space to forge friendships, build networks and join a growing community of MUN alumni shaping change around the world.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
